{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Before him.</b> Like לְפָנָיו, 'before him'; and likewise ״חָמָס וָשֹׁד יִשָּׁמַע בָּהּ עַל פָּנַי תָּמִיד״ (Jeremiah 6), and likewise ״הַמַּכְעִיסִים אֹתִי עַל פָּנַי״ (Isaiah 65). And another interpretation: עַל פָּנָיו — he too was steeped in anger, for all this was necessary (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:47.918429985Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}